{
  "slug": "twitter-command-center",
  "name": "Twitter Command Center",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Full Twitter/X data access and posting from Claude Code. Read user profiles, timelines, mentions, followers, tweet search (Latest/Top), replies, quotes, trending topics, lists, communities, and Spaces. Post tweets via OAuth relay — no passwords, no cookies, no proxies. Powered by AIsa API with pay-per-use pricing .",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `twitter` (Use PROACTIVELY when the user mentions Twitter, X, tweets, social media monitoring, social listening, influencer tracking, trending topics,…) and **1 command**, `twitter-search` (Search Twitter/X for tweets, users, or trends via AIsa API).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install twitter-command-center@claude-community` from `aisa-one/twitter-command-center`.",
